    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Species Feats\">Species Feats</a></i></p><p>You can navigate steep cliffs and caverns as though climbing were second nature to you.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sullustan\" title=\"Sullustan\">Sullustan</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b>&nbsp;Whenever you are not distracted or threatened, you gain a natural Climb Speed of 4 squares.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> Without a Climb Speed, you must succeed on a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Climb\" title=\"Climb\">Climb</a> check to climb.</p>",
